  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A natural finish foundation with weightless medium coverage that smooths and blurs for a second-skin effect, while providing all-day shine control and up to 16-hour hydration.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong><br>- Shine-Controlling Polymers and Lightweight Micro-Powders: Provide a smooth, softly blurred effect.</p><p>- Glycerin and Raspberry Extract: Lock in moisture and enhance skin’s hydration.</p><p>- Vitamin E: An antioxidant known to protect the skin barrier.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-The shade deepens slightly as the formula sets to its natural finish but does not oxidize throughout the day.<strong><br></strong>-Shake well before use.</p><p>-Start with one pump on the back of your hand then use the F1 Brush (sold separately) to tap product into the skin, starting with the center of the face and blending outwards. Gradually build to achieve fuller coverage as desired.</p><p>-Pro tip: Achieve Mario’s signature SurrealSkin effect by adding SurrealSkin Awakening Concealer, SurrealSkin Soft Blur Setting Powder, and finishing with SurrealSkin Soft Setting Spray (each sold separately).</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Shine-Controlling Polymers and Lightweight Micro-Powders: Provide a smooth, softly blurred effect.<br>-Glycerin and Raspberry Extract: Lock in moisture and enhance skin&rsquo;s hydration. <br>-Vitamin E: An antioxidant known to protect the skin barrier. <br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Dimethicone, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Methyl Trimethicone, Lauryl Dimethicone, Lauryl Peg-10 Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)Silylethyl Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Cellulose, C13-15 Alkane, Sd Alcohol 40-B (Alcohol Denat.), Sorbitan Isostearate, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Sodium Chloride, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phytic Acid, Tocopherol, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Leaf Extract (Rubus Idaeus Leaf Extract). [May Contain +/- Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A natural finish foundation with weightless medium coverage that smooths and blurs for a second-skin effect, while providing all-day shine control and up to 16-hour hydration.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><br><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><br><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong><br>- Shine-Controlling Polymers and Lightweight Micro-Powders: Provide a smooth, softly blurred effect.</p><p>- Glycerin and Raspberry Extract: Lock in moisture and enhance skin’s hydration.</p><p>- Vitamin E: An antioxidant known to protect the skin barrier.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-The shade deepens slightly as the formula sets to its natural finish but does not oxidize throughout the day.<strong><br></strong>-Shake well before use.</p><p>-Start with one pump on the back of your hand then use the F1 Brush (sold separately) to tap product into the skin, starting with the center of the face and blending outwards. Gradually build to achieve fuller coverage as desired.</p><p>-Pro tip: Achieve Mario’s signature SurrealSkin effect by adding SurrealSkin Awakening Concealer, SurrealSkin Soft Blur Setting Powder, and finishing with SurrealSkin Soft Setting Spray (each sold separately).</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Shine-Controlling Polymers and Lightweight Micro-Powders: Provide a smooth, softly blurred effect.<br>-Glycerin and Raspberry Extract: Lock in moisture and enhance skin&rsquo;s hydration. <br>-Vitamin E: An antioxidant known to protect the skin barrier. <br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Dimethicone, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Methyl Trimethicone, Lauryl Dimethicone, Lauryl Peg-10 Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)Silylethyl Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Cellulose, C13-15 Alkane, Sd Alcohol 40-B (Alcohol Denat.), Sorbitan Isostearate, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Sodium Chloride, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phytic Acid, Tocopherol, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Leaf Extract (Rubus Idaeus Leaf Extract). [May Contain +/- Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891)].</div></details>",
